  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      178.77,
      202.93,
      384.93,
      225.76
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE D. M. DASSANAYAKE SOCIALSERVICES AND CHARITY FOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      238.09,
      401.93,
      307.6
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the \u201cD. M.Dassanayake Social Services and Charity Foundation\u201d hasheretofore been established for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said Foundation according to the rulesagreed by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      319.93,
      401.89,
      377.8
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsfor which it was established and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      390.13,
      401.9,
      412.96
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      425.29,
      401.87,
      459.76
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the \u201cD. M. DassanayakeSocial Services and Charity Foundation\u201d (Incorporation)Act, No. of 2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      472.09,
      401.9,
      600.16
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of the commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cD. M. Dassanayake Social Services and CharityFoundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as \u201cFoundation\u201d) or shallhereafter be admitted as members of the Corporation herebyconstituted, shall be a body corporate (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetual succession, underthe name and style of the D. M. Dassanayake Social Servicesand Charity Foundation and by that name may sue and besued in all courts with full power and authority to have anduse a common seal and alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      612.49,
      401.87,
      635.2
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be as follows\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      647.53,
      401.86,
      670.48
    ],
    "text": "(a)to nurture the people through development requiredfor eliminating poverty of the Sri Lankan people;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      472.79,
      455.86,
      539.25
    ],
    "text": "Incorporationof the D. M.DassanayakeSocialServices andCharityFoundation.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      167.17,
      357.32,
      190.24
    ],
    "text": "D. M. Dassanayake Social Services andCharity Foundation (Incorporation)2",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
